    {
      "id": "isle_dree_warm_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“One strip of it.” She nods out at the water. “The jetty ices, the hut ices, the water in the hut ices. That strip does not, and it has not in my time or my father's.”"
        }
      ],
